# The production image builds from the repo root. Send only what deploy/docker/Dockerfile
# copies, so a local node_modules, dist, target or .env never reaches the build.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!migrations
!apps/web
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/.pnpm-store
apps/web/.env*
**/target
**/.DS_Store
